* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Title........: Replace all double blanks in string with single blank
* Program......: XXBLNK-N
* Author.......: GW
* Maintenance..:
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
DEFINE DATA
*
PARAMETER USING XXBLNK-A
*
LOCAL 1 #I (I1)
*
END-DEFINE
*
EXAMINE FULL #XX-BLNK-STRING FOR ' ' REPLACE H'FF'
REPEAT
  EXAMINE FULL #XX-BLNK-STRING FOR H'FFFF' REPLACE H'FF' GIVING NUMBER #I
  IF #I = 0
    EXAMINE FULL #XX-BLNK-STRING FOR H'FF' REPLACE ' '
    ESCAPE BOTTOM
  END-IF
END-REPEAT
*
END
